OL,3,ATrump pushes Apple to change 'Lake
OL,4,AOntario' to 'Lake America' on its maps
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has asked tech
OL,7,Ffirm Apple to rename Lake Ontario as
OL,8,FLake America on its Maps platform in
OL,9,Forder to comply with his executive
OL,10,Forder changing the name of the Great
OL,11,FLake, says Interior Secretary Doug
OL,12,FBurgum.
OL,14,FSpeaking to Fox News on Monday, Burgum
OL,15,Fsaid "the president has reached out to
OL,16,FApple directly", adding: "I'm sure we
OL,17,Fmay be seeing that change coming up
OL,18,Fsoon."
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
