OL,3,ATrump pushes Apple to change 'Lake
OL,4,AOntario' to 'Lake America' on its maps
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle made the switch for its US-based
OL,7,Fusers over the weekend, though users in
OL,8,FCanada still see the lake, which
OL,9,Fborders the province of Ontario and the
OL,10,Fstate of New York, as Lake Ontario.
OL,12,FThe BBC has contacted Apple for
OL,13,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
